msgid "Enter a keyword (e.g. kmod-wireguard) and click Search. Leave empty to list all available kmod packages (first 200)."
msgstr "输入关键字（如 kmod-wireguard）后点击搜索。留空则列出全部可用 kmod 包（前 200 个）。"

